Wait, if `resolve_relation` returns `('MyApp', 'basemodel')` and `reference_model_tuple` is `('myapp', 'basemodel')`, they won't be equal.

So we should probably lowercase the result of `resolve_relation` or make sure both sides are always lowercased.

Actually, the best place to fix this is in `resolve_relation` itself!

If `resolve_relation` always returns lowercase app labels and model names, then everyone who uses it will be happy.

